You can plot in your team size

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:08.680
and your average PR rates,
and it will give you a sense

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:14.120
of how much work and how much money
you're spending on iterative rework

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:18.640
that goes into some of these, 
redundant workflows as a result of

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:22.920
multiple operating systems
and inconsistent coding agent activity.

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:24.120
So we have a full report

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:27.800
called The State of Rework, 
and you can check that out on our website.

